          <text>"yes"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r5_out1">
          <text>"none"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r5_out2">
          <text>"Attached to the dwelling: item 2 covers only detached structures, and attaching one adds to a building (108.1 item 1)."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 2; 13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1 (reading): “One story detached structures used as tool and storage sheds, playhouses, or similar uses, provided the building area does not exceed 256 square feet (23.78 m 2 ) and the structures are not classified as a Group F-1 or H occupancy.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r6">
