          <text>"none"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r6_out2">
          <text>"A Group F-1 or H occupancy: item 2 excludes it, so the permit duty of 108.1 applies."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 2; 13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1: “One story detached structures used as tool and storage sheds, playhouses, or similar uses, provided the building area does not exceed 256 square feet (23.78 m 2 ) and the structures are not classified as a Group F-1 or H occupancy.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r7">
        <description>VA: deck (any size, height or attachment)</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="A/1" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="implied" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Construction or demolition of a building or structure.</lex:quote>
              <lex:note>Reading: the 16 items of 108.2 name no deck (the only 'deck' in them is roof decking, item 14.6), so a deck is construction of a structure under 108.1 item 1.</lex:note>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 13" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B/13" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Construction work deemed by the building official to be minor and ordinary and that does not adversely affect public health or general safety.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-10 G (USBC 101.7)" section="13VAC5-63-10" subsection="G" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="implied" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section10/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_10">
              <lex:quote>Any provisions of Chapters 2 through 35 of the IBC or any provisions of the codes and standards referenced in the IBC that address the same subject matter and impose differing requirements are deleted and replaced by the provisions of Chapter 1.</lex:quote>
              <lex:note>Reading: a permit exemption for decks in a code the IBC references addresses the same subject as 108.2 and differs from it, so Chapter 1 replaces it; only 108.2's list counts.</lex:note>
            </lex:source>
          </lex:grounding>
        </extensionElements>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in0">
          <text>"va"</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in1">
          <text>"deck"</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in2">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in3">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in4">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in5">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in6">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in7">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in8">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in9">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in10">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in11">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in12">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in13">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in14">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in15">
          <text>false</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_in16">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_out0">
          <text>"yes"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_out1">
          <text>"none"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r7_out2">
          <text>"No item of 108.2 covers decks, so a permit is required, whatever the deck's size, height above grade or attachment, unless the building official deems the work minor and ordinary (item 13). A deck exemption in a model code does not apply: Chapter 1 replaces model-code provisions on the same subject that differ (101.7)."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1 (reading); 13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 13; 13VAC5-63-10 G (USBC 101.7) (reading): “Construction or demolition of a building or structure.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r8">
        <description>VA: replacing deck boards, railings or treads on the existing framing</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="A/1" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="implied" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Construction or demolition of a building or structure.</lex:quote>
              <lex:note>Reading: a deck is a structure, and replacing its boards, railings or treads is a repair of it.</lex:note>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-200 (USBC 202), Construction" section="13VAC5-63-200" subsection="A" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section200/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_200">
              <lex:quote>Construction. The construction, reconstruction, alteration, repair, or conversion of buildings and structures.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 14.11" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B/14.11" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Other repair work deemed by the building official to be minor and ordinary which does not adversely affect public health or general safety.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
          </lex:grounding>
        </extensionElements>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in0">
          <text>"va"</text>
        </inputEntry>
