          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in10">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in11">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in12">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in13">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in14">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in15">
          <text>false</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_in16">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_out0">
          <text>"yes"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_out1">
          <text>"none"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r8_out2">
          <text>"Replacing deck boards is a repair of a structure, and the VCC's 'Construction' includes repair (13VAC5-63-200), so 108.1 item 1 requires a permit, unless the building official deems it minor and ordinary repair work (item 14.11). Ask the building official whether item 14.11 applies."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1 (reading); 13VAC5-63-200 (USBC 202), Construction; 13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 14.11: “Construction or demolition of a building or structure.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r9">
        <description>VA: fence (new or repaired), not a pool barrier or safety fence</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 5" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B/5" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Fences of any height unless required for pedestrian safety as provided for by Section 3306 or used for the barrier for a swimming pool.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2)" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>application for a permit and any related inspections shall not be required for the following</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2)" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>however, this section shall not be construed to exempt such activities from other applicable requirements of this code</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
          </lex:grounding>
        </extensionElements>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in0">
          <text>"va"</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in1">
          <text>"fence","fence_repair"</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in2">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in3">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
