          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in10">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in11">
          <text>false</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in12">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in13">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in14">
          <text>false</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in15">
          <text>false</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_in16">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_out0">
          <text>"no"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_out1">
          <text>"13VAC5-63-80 B item 5"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r9_out2">
          <text>"Exempt: fences of any height, new, replaced or repaired, unless used as a pool barrier or required for pedestrian safety. The exemption is from the permit only: the fence must still meet the code (108.2). This is for the structure alone: wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work with it needs a permit (trade_work)."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 5; 13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2): “Fences of any height unless required for pedestrian safety as provided for by Section 3306 or used for the barrier for a swimming pool.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r10">
        <description>VA: an item-5 fence in a special flood hazard area</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), Exception 2" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B/exceptions/2" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Application for a permit may be required by the building official for any items exempted in this section that are located in a special flood hazard area.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 5" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B/5" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Fences of any height unless required for pedestrian safety as provided for by Section 3306 or used for the barrier for a swimming pool.</lex:quote>
