          <text>"depends"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r10_out1">
          <text>"13VAC5-63-80 B item 5 and Exception 2"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r10_out2">
          <text>"Exempt by item 5, but in a special flood hazard area the building official may require a permit application. This is for the structure alone: wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work with it needs a permit (trade_work)."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), Exception 2; 13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 5: “Application for a permit may be required by the building official for any items exempted in this section that are located in a special flood hazard area.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
