          <text>false</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r13_in16">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r13_out0">
          <text>"no"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r13_out1">
          <text>"13VAC5-63-80 B item 6"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r13_out2">
          <text>"Exempt: a concrete or masonry wall no more than six feet above the finished grade; ornamental column caps do not count toward the height. The exemption is from the permit only: the wall must still meet the code (108.2). This is for the structure alone: wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work with it needs a permit (trade_work)."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 6; 13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2): “Concrete or masonry walls, provided such walls do not exceed six feet in height above the finished grade.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
