        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r16_out2">
          <text>"Exempt: a retaining wall supporting less than three feet of unbalanced fill, with no surcharge and not impounding flammable or combustible liquids. The exemption is from the permit only: the wall must still meet the code (108.2). This is for the structure alone: wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work with it needs a permit (trade_work)."</text>
