        <annotationEntry>
          <text>12-A DCMR 105.2, Building item 8; 12-A DCMR 105.1: “A single garden storage shed that does not exceed 50 square feet (4.65 m2) in area, is less than ten feet (3048 mm) in overall height, is an accessory structure to a building of Use Group R-3 or to a building under the jurisdiction of the Residential Code, and is erected on a lot with no other exempted storage shed.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r28">
        <description>DC: tree house or playhouse of 36 sq ft or less, not historic, not in a Flood Hazard Area</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="12-A DCMR 105.2, Building item 13" section="12-A DCMR 105" subsection="105.2/building/13" code="DCMR" jurisdiction="dc" grounding="explicit" url="https://dcregs.dc.gov/Common/DCMR/RuleList.aspx?DownloadFile={64284980-8CFE-4134-BB96-94FBB25965E0}" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_DC_DCMR_T12_A_C2017_12_A1_S105_EDConstruction_Codes_Supplement_of_2017">
              <lex:quote>A tree house or playhouse, no more than 36 square feet, (3.35 m2) in area and accessory to detached one- and two-family dwellings and townhouses.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="12-A DCMR 105.2" section="12-A DCMR 105" subsection="105.2" code="DCMR" jurisdiction="dc" grounding="explicit" url="https://dcregs.dc.gov/Common/DCMR/RuleList.aspx?DownloadFile={64284980-8CFE-4134-BB96-94FBB25965E0}" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_DC_DCMR_T12_A_C2017_12_A1_S105_EDConstruction_Codes_Supplement_of_2017">
              <lex:quote>This Section 105.2 sets forth exemptions from permit requirements, subject to historic and Flood Hazard Area restrictions set forth in Sections 105.2.5 and 105.2.6 respectively.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
          </lex:grounding>
        </extensionElements>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r28_in0">
