        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r30_out0">
          <text>"yes"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r30_out1">
          <text>"12-A DCMR 105.2 item 13, not available under 105.2.6"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r30_out2">
          <text>"In a Flood Hazard Area, a permit application subject only to review by the Floodplain Administrator is required (and, if historic, ask the Historic Preservation Office as well)."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>12-A DCMR 105.2.6; 12-A DCMR 105.2, Building item 13: “and the work is to occur on premises wholly or partially within a Flood Hazard Area, an application for a permit subject only to review by the Floodplain Administrator shall be required.”</text>
