        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r36_in16">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r36_out0">
          <text>"depends"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r36_out1">
          <text>"12-A DCMR 105.2 item 4, limited by 105.2.5"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r36_out2">
          <text>"In a historic district a permit application subject only to historic preservation review is required for fence repair or replacement, unless the work is deemed an ordinary repair. This is for the structure alone: wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work with it needs a permit (trade_work)."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>12-A DCMR 105.2.5: “4. Repair or replacement of fences, except as deemed an ordinary repair”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r37">
        <description>DC: fence repair in a Flood Hazard Area</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="12-A DCMR 105.2.6" section="12-A DCMR 105" subsection="105.2.6" code="DCMR" jurisdiction="dc" grounding="explicit" url="https://dcregs.dc.gov/Common/DCMR/RuleList.aspx?DownloadFile={64284980-8CFE-4134-BB96-94FBB25965E0}" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_DC_DCMR_T12_A_C2017_12_A1_S105_EDConstruction_Codes_Supplement_of_2017">
              <lex:quote>and the work is to occur on premises wholly or partially within a Flood Hazard Area, an application for a permit subject only to review by the Floodplain Administrator shall be required.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="12-A DCMR 105.2, Building item 4" section="12-A DCMR 105" subsection="105.2/building/4" code="DCMR" jurisdiction="dc" grounding="explicit" url="https://dcregs.dc.gov/Common/DCMR/RuleList.aspx?DownloadFile={64284980-8CFE-4134-BB96-94FBB25965E0}" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_DC_DCMR_T12_A_C2017_12_A1_S105_EDConstruction_Codes_Supplement_of_2017">
              <lex:quote>Repair in kind of existing fences.</lex:quote>
