          <text>12-A DCMR 105.2.5; 12-A DCMR 105.2.6; 10-C DCMR 304.2(e): “and the work is to occur on the land of or the exterior of buildings or other structures located in historic districts, or of historically designated buildings or other structures, an application for a building permit subject only to historic preservation review pursuant to Section 105.1 shall be required for the following work described in Section 105.2 Building”</text>
