        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r54_out1">
          <text>"13VAC5-63-20 D item 9 (flood-proofing)"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r54_out2">
          <text>"Exempt from the USBC (102.3 item 9), but a farm building or structure in a flood plain is subject to flood-proofing regulations. Ask the building official and the local floodplain administrator. This assumes no wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work; with such work, ask the building official."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-20 D (USBC 102.3), item 9 (reading): “However, farm buildings and structures lying within a flood plain or in a mudslide-prone area shall be subject to flood-proofing regulations or mudslide regulations, as applicable.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r55">
