        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r55_out1">
          <text>"13VAC5-63-20 D item 7"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r55_out2">
          <text>"Exempt from the USBC altogether (102.3 item 7): swing sets, sliding boards, climbing bars, jungle gyms, skateboard ramps and similar equipment. A play structure that is a small building is a playhouse (108.2 item 2). This assumes no wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work; with such work, ask the building official."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-20 D (USBC 102.3), item 7; 13VAC5-63-20 D (USBC 102.3): “Playground or recreational equipment, such as swing sets, sliding boards, climbing bars, jungle gyms, skateboard ramps, and similar equipment.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r56">
        <description>VA: wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="A/1" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>(v) water supply and distribution system, sanitary drainage system, or vent system; (vi) electric wiring; (vii) fire protection system, mechanical systems, or fuel supply systems</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1)" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="A" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Application for a permit shall be made to the building official and a permit shall be obtained prior to the commencement of any of the following activities</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 1" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B/1" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="implied" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>Installation of wiring and equipment that (i) operates at less than 50 volts, (ii) is for broadband communications systems, (iii) is exempt under Section 102.3(1) or 102.3(4), or (iv) is for monitoring or automation systems in dwelling units</lex:quote>
              <lex:note>Reading: an item of 108.2 that exempts a structure does not exempt the wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical installations made with it; 108.2 exempts wiring only in item 1 and replacements only in items 10 and 14.2 to 14.4.</lex:note>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2)" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="B" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>however, this section shall not be construed to exempt such activities from other applicable requirements of this code</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
          </lex:grounding>
        </extensionElements>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in0">
          <text>"va"</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in1">
          <text>"shed","playhouse","deck","deck_resurfacing","fence","fence_repair","masonry_wall","retaining_wall","addition"</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in2">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in3">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in4">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in5">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in6">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in7">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in8">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in9">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in10">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in11">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in12">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in13">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in14">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in15">
          <text>true</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_in16">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_out0">
          <text>"yes"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_out1">
          <text>"none (trade work)"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r56_out2">
          <text>"Wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work needs a permit: 108.1 item 1 requires one for installations involving water supply, drainage and vent systems, electric wiring, and mechanical and fuel supply systems, and 108.2 exempts only low-voltage, broadband, utility and monitoring wiring (item 1) and some like-for-like replacements (items 10 and 14.2 to 14.4). An item that exempts the structure (a shed, a fence, a wall) does not exempt its wiring or piping. Whether the structure itself needs a permit is the answer with trade_work false."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1; 13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1); 13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2), item 1 (reading); 13VAC5-63-80 B (USBC 108.2): “(v) water supply and distribution system, sanitary drainage system, or vent system; (vi) electric wiring; (vii) fire protection system, mechanical systems, or fuel supply systems”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_permit_required_r57">
        <description>VA: wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work with a structure outside the USBC (102.3)</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-20 D (USBC 102.3)" section="13VAC5-63-20" subsection="D" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="explicit" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section20/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_20">
              <lex:quote>The following are exempt from this code</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
            <lex:source citation="13VAC5-63-80 A (USBC 108.1), item 1" section="13VAC5-63-80" subsection="A/1" code="VAC" jurisdiction="va" grounding="implied" url="https://law.lis.virginia.gov/admincode/title13/agency5/chapter63/section80/" corpus="regulations" actId="STATE_VA_ADC_13_5_63_80">
              <lex:quote>(v) water supply and distribution system, sanitary drainage system, or vent system; (vi) electric wiring; (vii) fire protection system, mechanical systems, or fuel supply systems</lex:quote>
              <lex:note>Reading: whether 102.3's exemption of a farm building, a storage container or play equipment reaches wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical work in or to it is not settled by the text.</lex:note>
            </lex:source>
          </lex:grounding>
        </extensionElements>
        <inputEntry id="d_permit_required_r57_in0">
