        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r57_out0">
          <text>"depends"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r57_out1">
          <text>"13VAC5-63-20 D item 7, 9 or 11 (the structure)"</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_permit_required_r57_out2">
          <text>"The structure is outside the USBC (102.3), but 108.1 item 1 requires a permit for installations involving wiring, plumbing, gas or mechanical systems. Whether the exemption reaches the trade work in or to the structure the text does not say. Ask the building official."</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
